{"id": "37093", "title": "糖醋丈夫", "author": "阳光晴子", "category": "文学名著", "count": 19, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37093.htm", "intro": "歹命的她，从小就遭受父亲的“苦毒”，\r\n幸好有哥哥的这一片天，\r\n抚慰了她受伤的心灵，\r\n偏偏这段纯纯的爱恋，\r\n在各自已被安排了未婚伴侣下，全变了天，\r\n然而，她万万没料到——\r\n丧心病狂的父亲，为了报复她亲生父母，\r\n不但隐瞒他们不是兄妹的事实，\r\n还故意设计陷害他们误尝禁果发生关系，\r\n继而利用亲情和爱情教她当个代罪羔羊——\r\n要她掏空公司资产及承认谋害未婚夫，\r\n天啊！她虽只是个养女，\r\n可俗话说：虎毒不食子，\r\n父亲怎可如此残忍待她呢……", "base": "files/article/html/37/37093", "chapters": [{"title": "第1章(1)", "file": "2909976.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(2)", "file": "2909977.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(1)", "file": "2909978.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(2)", "file": "2909979.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(1)", "file": "2909980.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(2)", "file": "2909981.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(1)", "file": "2909982.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(2)", "file": "2909983.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第5章(1)", "file": "2909984.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第5章(2)", "file": "2909985.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章", "file": "2909986.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(1)", "file": "2909987.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(2)", "file": "2909988.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(1)", "file": "2909989.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(2)", "file": "2909990.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(1)", "file": "2909991.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(2)", "file": "2909992.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(1)", "file": "2909993.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(2)", "file": "2909994.html", "available": true}]}